<p class="paragraph"><a title="" name="_ftn4" href="#_ftnref4">4.</a> See Leduc and Liu (2013) for estimates of the effects of uncertainty and references to the literature.</p>
<p class="paragraph"><a title="" name="_ftn5" href="#_ftnref5">5.</a> For more information, see the statement of longer-term goals and policy strategy released by the FOMC in the press release dated January 25, 2012 (Board of Governors 2012a).</p>
<p class="paragraph"><a title="" name="_ftn6" href="#_ftnref6">6.</a> See Williams (2011, 2012).</p>
<p class="paragraph"><a title="" name="_ftn7" href="#_ftnref7">7.</a> See Board of Governors (2011).</p>
<p class="paragraph"><a title="" name="_ftn8" href="#_ftnref8">8.</a> See Board of Governors (2012b).</p>
<p><a title="" name="_ftn9" href="#_ftnref9">9.</a> See Board of Governors (2013).</p>
